{"id":"df5d797c8140627c","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-inner2-generic-mantle.md","title":"ZFC Inner2 Generic Mantle","display":"df-zfc-inner2-generic-mantle — ZFC Inner2 Generic Mantle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner2-generic-mantle","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner2-generic-mantle","58-df-zfc-inner4-generic-mantle"],"display":"df-zfc-inner2-generic-mantle — ZFC Inner2 Generic Mantle","depends_on":["[[58-df-ground]]","[[58-df-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner2-generic-mantle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner2-generic-mantle</span><span>58-df-zfc-inner4-generic-mantle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner2-generic-mantle — ZFC Inner2 Generic Mantle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"58-df-ground\">58-df-ground</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb G\">\\(\\mathbb G\\)</span> (generic-mantle class candidate) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,W\">\\(U,W\\)</span> (class-model variables).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,U)\\)</span> (source predicates).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall_{\\mathsf{Class}}\">\\(\\forall_{\\mathsf{Class}}\\)</span> denotes metalinguistic quantification over definable class models.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2GenericMantle}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner2GenericMantle}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4GenericMantle}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4GenericMantle}_S\\)</span> (merged predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}generic\\text{-}mantle}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2GenericMantle}_S[\\mathbb G]\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(\\mathbb G)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\left(\nx\\in\\mathbb G\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall_{\\mathsf{Class}}U\\;\\forall_{\\mathsf{Class}}W\\;\n\\bigl((\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(V,U)\\land\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,U))\\to x\\in W\\bigr)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}generic\\text{-}mantle}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2GenericMantle}_S[\\mathbb G]\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(\\mathbb G)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\left(\nx\\in\\mathbb G\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall_{\\mathsf{Class}}U\\;\\forall_{\\mathsf{Class}}W\\;\n\\bigl((\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(V,U)\\land\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,U))\\to x\\in W\\bigr)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}generic\\text{-}mantle}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4GenericMantle}_S[\\mathbb G]\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2GenericMantle}_S[\\mathbb G].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}generic\\text{-}mantle}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4GenericMantle}_S[\\mathbb G]\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2GenericMantle}_S[\\mathbb G].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The defining condition and turnstile are metatheoretic: they range over every class model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> for which <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> is a ground and every ground <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> of that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>, never treating the universe or mantle as a set.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-inner4-generic-mantle</code> is merged here; it used the same intersection of generic grounds.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ground","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ground]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb G","display":false},{"tex":"U,W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall_{\\mathsf{Class}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2GenericMantle}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4GenericMantle}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}generic\\text{-}mantle}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2GenericMantle}_S[\\mathbb G]\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(\\mathbb G)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\left(\nx\\in\\mathbb G\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall_{\\mathsf{Class}}U\\;\\forall_{\\mathsf{Class}}W\\;\n\\bigl((\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(V,U)\\land\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,U))\\to x\\in W\\bigr)\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}generic\\text{-}mantle}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4GenericMantle}_S[\\mathbb G]\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2GenericMantle}_S[\\mathbb G].","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":1682,"backlinks":[{"id":"398389469f4b867f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcInner2GenericMantle}_S[\\operatorname{gM}]$ 为 [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-inner2-generic-mantle.md]] 的类量词模式。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2351","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-inner2-generic-mantle.md|58-df-zfc-inner2-generic-mantle]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["d0244462250ae67e","ca2a9c9166fa8cce"]}